{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415705","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415705","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041570501:0":{"text":"你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？","source_cn":"你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3878DEE9A94A5967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570502:0":{"text":"你一点也不像神明。","source_cn":"你一点也不像神明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E61292169DBB388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570503:0":{"text":"哦？你觉得神应该是什么样？","source_cn":"哦？你觉得神应该是什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48EFC5D84922A050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570504:0":{"text":"我见过的神不多。","source_cn":"我见过的神不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC32D001AE67528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570505:1":{"text":"但我同族所信仰的神明……嗜血，傲慢，蔑视信徒。","source_cn":"但我同族所信仰的神明……嗜血，傲慢，蔑视信徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7DE4CE2F0C9175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570506:1":{"text":"年轻人，我看得出你眼中充斥着仇恨。","source_cn":"年轻人，我看得出你眼中充斥着仇恨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F77E29CE93C5B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570507:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570508:1":{"text":"放松点吧。所谓之“战神”，不过是一个荣耀的称号。","source_cn":"放松点吧。所谓之“战神”，不过是一个荣耀的称号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D504932C0B5734E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570509:1":{"text":"终有一日，这个称号会由击败我的人继承。","source_cn":"终有一日，这个称号会由击败我的人继承。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8166895E4F179431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570510:1":{"text":"看得出你是一名优秀的战士。若是你能通过试炼，在战歌节上与我堂堂正正地对战，或许这称号有机会落在你的头上。","source_cn":"看得出你是一名优秀的战士。若是你能通过试炼，在战歌节上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x110610C3BF198315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570511:1":{"text":"试炼？节日？！……你们要做什么？","source_cn":"试炼？节日？！……你们要做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43ADD54CDA06B9B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_